    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'ki'ndi'ka na ku'sondohiwa kwa ihema",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mu lu'siku' lwa kwandya lwa mwezi gwa kwandya, u'lali'ki'ndi'ke Ihema Isondo, yaani Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugati' na ihema lyeni'lo u'latu'u'le isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa, hangi' u'lali'ki'ge na muki'ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'laingi'zye meza na ku'hela vintu' ha igu'lya yayo. U'laingi'zye i'cho ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala hangi' na ku'zitu'u'la tala zyacho ha igu'lya yacho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihozezyo lya zahabu lya ku'zuki'zya wu'bani, u'lali'tu'u'le ha mbele ya isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa. Hangi' u'lenenie muki'ngo ku' wingi'li'lo wa Ihema Isondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' ha mbele ya wingi'li'lo wa Ihema Isondo, yaani Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, u'latu'u'le i'lo ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikalaye u'lali'tu'u'le hagati' ya Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya na ihozezyo, na ku'lyokazya minzi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lapilimye lu'gu'tu' na ku'enenia muki'ngo ha wingi'li'lo walo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hangi' u'lasole maguta ga ku'v'ila na ku'li'v'ila Ihema Isondo haki'mo na vintu' vyalyo vyose. U'lali'sondohye haki'mo na vilwani'lo vyose i'vyo vili' mugati' yalyo, nalyo li'lav'e isondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' u'lali'v'ile maguta ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo haki'mo na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose, na ku'li'sondohya ihozezyo, nalyo li'lav'e isondo muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikalaye haki'mo na kikali'lo chalyo, u'lali'v'ile maguta na ku'li'sondohya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lav'alete Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, nanho u'lav'akuse na minzi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' u'lamuzwi'ke Aloni i'vyo vizwalo visondo, na ku'muv'ila maguta na ku'musondohya, ki'gele antu'mami'le muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyene vivyo u'lav'alete v'ana v'akwe na ku'v'azwi'ka i'zyo nhanzo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' u'lav'av'ile maguta ki'ti' i'vyo wamuv'ilaga sav'o, ki'gele nav'o v'antu'mami'le muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. Ku'v'ilwa maguta kwenu'ku' ku'lav'ingi'zye mu wu'hozya wa wu'leka ku' wu'v'yalwa wav'o wose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene, Mose wagelani'zyaga ki'la ki'ntu' ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'age mu lu'siku' lwa kwandya lwa mwezi gwa kwandya, mwaka gwa wu'v'i'li' gwa ku'fuma ku' Misili, Ihema Isondo lyaki'ndi'kagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose watu'u'laga vikali'lo vyalyo na ku'wu'sya felemu zyalyo, wazidimani'zyaga ngito zyalyo na kwi'mi'kya nhi'ngi' zyalyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasagalaga nfundi' ya miki'ngo ha igu'lya na Ihema Isondo, na ku'tu'u'la nfundi' zya ndi'li' ha igu'lya yalyo, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wasolaga ago mav'ale av'i'li' ga mawe ga wu'sangi'lwa na ku'gatu'u'la mu i'lo isandi'ko. Watu'u'laga zyeni'zyo miti' mu pete zya isandi'ko na watu'u'laga nfundi' ya wu'swanano ha igu'lya yalyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wali'tu'u'laga mu ihema na ku'enenia muki'ngo, ki'gele ali'ki'ge isandi'ko lyeni'lo, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu'u'laga meza mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ku' lwandi' lwa sukuma lwa ihema, ha ibala na muki'ngo gwenu'go, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ku'hela migate ha igu'lya na meza ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu'u'laga ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ku' lwandi' lwa dakama, matanda na meza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wazihelaga tala ha igu'lya yacho ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wali'tu'u'laga ihozezyo lya zahabu mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ha mbele na muki'ngo gwa mugati', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ku'zuki'zya wu'bani wu'motu ha igu'lya, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' weneniaga muki'ngo ha wingi'li'lo wa Ihema Isondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wali'tu'u'laga ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, na wafumyaga ki'taambo cha ku'zigya na kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo vya mu mugu'nda ha igu'lya yalyo, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wali'tu'u'laga ikalaye hagati' na Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya na ihozezyo, na ku'ti'ti'la minzi' ku'nguno ya kwikusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose, Aloni na v'ana v'akwe, v'ose v'agatu'mi'laga ku' ku'kusi'la makono na magu'lu' gav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la aho v'av'age v'ali'wingi'la mu ihema, ninga aho v'ali'lyegela ihozezyo, v'ikusage, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose waki'ndi'kaga lu'gu'tu' ku'li'pilima ihema lyeni'lo na ihozezyo, na ku'tu'u'la muki'ngo ha wingi'li'lo wa lu'gu'tu'. Hu' i'vyo Mose wagelani'zyaga muli'mo gose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu mugati' na ihema",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
