          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' ilunde lyali'kumbi'laga i'lo Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, na lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu lokalaga mu ihema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninga Mose akakowolile kwingi'la mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ku'nguno i'lo ilunde likalaga ha igu'lya yalyo, na lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu lokalaga mwenu'mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku' misi'nzo zyav'o zyose V'aizilaeli itungo ilunde lyeni'lo aho lyawu'siv'agwe ku'fuma ha igu'lya na Ihema Isondo, haho v'awu'kage musi'nzo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ali'vi u'lu' ilunde li'kawu'siv'ilwe, na v'eni'ki'li' v'akawu'kile mpaka lu'siku' u'lo lyawu'siv'agwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku' misi'nzo zyav'o zyose, iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli v'ali'wonage i'lo ilunde lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ha igu'lya na Ihema Isondo ha itungo lya lyu'v'a, na u'go moto gwav'akage wu'ziku' mu ilunde lyeni'lo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.38",
